{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026L52wNLdk8o1793612158.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳一段車 Cam 片段，直擊有路人於啟德馬路上低頭使用手機，引發網民對道路安全的討論。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-02-17h06m49s350.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xBCKn1RS9Z1793612122.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>片中可見，涉事車輛當時正沿啟德承景街駛往承豐道方向，當行至承豐道迴旋處附近時，行車線上突然出現一名女子。該女子一手拉着行李箱站在馬路上，全程低頭密密撳手機。司機見狀隨即在行車道上停下避讓數秒，女子事後疑察覺阻街，才拖着行李箱往後退，惟她退至路邊後仍持續低頭看手機，未有步回行人路。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-02-17h07m15s112.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FwMCL45w991793612136.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>相關片段引發網民廣泛討論，不少人指出在行車線上逗留及看手機的舉動非常危險，留言表示：「好心急撳電話？」、「撳少陣唔得？」，更有網民反諷寫道：「係咪幾百萬上落」。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T01:42:27.382731+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T01:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T21:18:27.571788+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T01:39:03.321114+00:00","content_hash":"cc26ebc0b9acf41dcc656f474ac4996099c1605b6a4e8e3e2c5283ffa57be5b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T01:42:27.382731+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}